WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:10.428
Five things wait for the owner, on two canvases. The needs you button no longer jumps to one of them. It slides out an inbox, docked to the edge like the Obeya chat, with the canvas moving aside.

00:00:11.383 --> 00:00:21.031
Every entry names its canvas small on top, the card in large type, and what it waits for in lighter text. Entries from all canvases stand in one list, the most recent first.

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:31.388
Buttons answer in one click. Only the default is dark: approve on a handover, or the option the agent would choose on a question. Go to card is always there, and always plain.

00:00:32.341 --> 00:00:40.758
Choosing the date format answers the agent, and the entry leaves the inbox. Approving the push notification card works the same, although it lives on the other canvas.

00:00:41.712 --> 00:00:46.008
Go to card opens the card, here on the other canvas, which is switched to on the way.
